<title>INDIA: RBI ISSUES 30.05 BLN RUPEES OF 14-DAY T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>RBI ISSUES 30.05 BLN RUPEES OF 14-DAY T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it issued 14-day treasury bills to a total face value of 30.05 billion rupees at its auction on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom (91) 22-265 9000; Fax (91) 22 264 1699</p>
